  The `create_file` / `update_file` / `delete_file` operation shape follows the
  OpenAI Agents SDK's ApplyPatchOperation, packages/agents-core/src/types/protocol.ts
  in the repository and under the licence reproduced at the top of this file,
  because the vendored applier is that SDK's and its own callers pass it exactly
  these three shapes.
